se body and second GET assertions\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 1 test: reject shipment creation for cancelled order with second GET verification\n\nTests:\n- `cancels_active_order_and_persists_status` — POST /orders/O-1/cancel succeeds, response shows CANCELLED, GET /orders/O-1 persists it\n- `cancel_cancels_all_created_shipments_of_the_order` — Shipments with status CREATED are transitioned to CANCELLED when order is cancelled\n- `repeated_cancel_succeeds_and_changes_nothing` — Calling cancel twice on already-cancelled order succeeds both times\n- `cancel_blocked_by_confirmed_shipment_returns_409_with_error_code_and_changes_nothing` — CONFIRMED shipment blocks cancel with 409/SHIPMENT_CONFIRMED code, verified unchanged with GET requests\n- `cancel_unknown_order_returns_404_with_error_code` — Unknown orderId returns 404 with ORDER_NOT_FOUND code\n- `rejects_shipment_creation_for_cancelled_order_with_error_code_and_changes_nothing` — POST /shipments for cancelled order fails with 409/ORDER_CANCELLED code, verified no shipment created with GET\n\nVerification: `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` — BUILD SUCCESS, 19 tests passed (3 existing + 6 new OrderControllerTest + 2 existing + 1 new ShipmentControllerTest + 3 Customer + 1 SampleService)\n\nNot done: Nothing; all acceptance criteria met."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3328,"cache_read_input_tokens":39031,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3328},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e9c014ec-51ad-4c5c-bedd-b2575e127b70","uuid":"9bd8ab31-363a-4f83-88c7-102746eecf10","timestamp":"2026-09-09T18:42:37.527Z","request_id":"req_011CetMg5bqMQAS7X7o8pxst"}
